pipeline is also the **measurement device** that extracts `n_fold` from rendered images in the first place (angular autocorrelation / FFT peak-picking), so the descriptor and the discrete feature are consistent by construction.

### 2.5 Composite distance

```
D(i, j) = Σ_f w_f · d_f(i, j) / Σ_f w_f · 1[d_f observed]
```

Pre-registered weights (sum = 1 over the full feature set):

| feature | w | justification |
|---|---|---|
| n_fold | 0.20 | primary cross-domain invariant |
| mode pair (§2.2) | 0.20 | the hypothesis of interest (vibration modes) |
| ratio_sig | 0.15 | classical "sacred proportion" claim |
| fourier_desc | 0.15 | holistic shape |
| is_spiral / is_grid / is_concentric | 0.05 each | topology flags |
| log_size | 0.05 | deliberately weak |
| chirality bit | 0.05 | tiebreaker |
| n_fold ⊕ mode redundancy guard | — | see edge cases |

Similarity reported as `S = 1 − D`.

